1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
In this town, every kid counts the stairs.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Nobody tells the secret of the third step.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
My mom says the rule started years ago.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
I thought it was just a silly game.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Then the lamps went out one by one.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Grandma hummed and never looked up.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
The stairs groaned under my feet.

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:41,000
That's when I noticed the dog was missing.

9
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Every window on the hill went dark at once.

10
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:51,000
I counted the steps, and they counted me back.

11
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Mom finally whispered the old rule to me.

12
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Every night, I still count the stairs.
